  <title>Release notes from dynamo</title>
  <updated>2026-10-09T23:26:34Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-10T00:03:10Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1&lt;/strong&gt; is an experimental snapshot build with early &lt;strong&gt;MiniMax M3&lt;/strong&gt; support on the Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt; backend. It is &lt;strong&gt;not recommended for production&lt;/strong&gt; and is not a QA-gated release. APIs, behavior, and defaults may change before stable support. Use it for evaluation, testing, and early feedback only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1 serves &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvidia/MiniMax-M3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;. The published container is built from pinned vLLM nightly &lt;code&gt;8a728663c1c3&lt;/code&gt; (CUDA 13) and includes the MiniMax M3 reasoning and structured-output parser, a GB200-safe vision patch embedding, and KV-offload fixes for EAGLE/MTP. vLLM-Omni is excluded from this image. Prefill load accounting charges only GPU compute, and finalized VP9/WebM inputs can be decoded when duration is stored on the container rather than the stream (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14856&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes recipes serve the same checkpoint on GB200 with tensor parallelism 4, FP8 KV cache, real EAGLE3 verification, KV-aware routing, and a one-million-token context. The aggregated profile uses 12 GPUs and 400 GB of CPU KV offload per replica. The disaggregated profile uses 24 GPUs and transfers KV from prefill to decode with NIXL. Both profiles share a model-cache download for the target and &lt;code&gt;Inferact/MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA&lt;/code&gt; draft, and a perf/trace reference ships with the recipes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15096&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15096/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15096&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16043&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16043/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16043&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;, tip &lt;code&gt;1cf43bce3fc865a14dcd8f9bb857f6b726617ed0&lt;/code&gt; (2026-10-09)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;: nightly &lt;code&gt;8a728663c1c3&lt;/code&gt; (CUDA 13), NIXL v1.3.2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Images&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Arch&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM (CUDA 13)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multi-arch (&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.6.0-minimax-m3-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Versions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on pinned nightly &lt;code&gt;vllm-nightly-8a728663c1c3&lt;/code&gt;, with MiniMax M3 reasoning, vision, and KV-offload patches&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NIXL v1.3.2; Transformers 5.14.1; tokenizers 0.22.2; vLLM-Omni excluded&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Model&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GPU&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvidia/MiniMax-M3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NVFP4&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;12x GB200 aggregated, 24x GB200 disaggregated&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;target checkpoint, revision &lt;code&gt;901464083161bf8612a29ff7ad29914cd4ab4a85&lt;/code&gt;; FP8 KV; up to 1M context; multimodal input enabled&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Inferact/MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;with both profiles&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;EAGLE3 draft, revision &lt;code&gt;96692486b5fd38ebf8fd2a5f6bb53427d30819a8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MiniMax M3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MiniMax M3&lt;/strong&gt; is served in this preview as &lt;code&gt;nvidia/MiniMax-M3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt; (NVFP4) through Dynamo&#39;s vLLM backend on GB200, with aggregated or prefill/decode disaggregated workers, EAGLE3 speculative decoding, and KV-aware routing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MiniMax M3 runtime:&lt;/strong&gt; Pins the CUDA 13 vLLM runtime to nightly &lt;code&gt;8a728663c1c3&lt;/code&gt; and applies the MiniMax M3 reasoning/structured-output parser, the vision-tower patch embedding used on GB200, and KV-offload fixes that keep the final sampled token out of the prefix cache and preserve EAGLE/MTP offload hits. vLLM-Omni is not installed (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14856&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Routing and media decode:&lt;/strong&gt; Prefill load accounting counts only tokens that still need GPU compute, including when KV is already resident on host or disk. Finalized VP9/WebM inputs decode when duration is present on the container and missing from the video stream (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14856/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14856&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MiniMax M3 recipes:&lt;/strong&gt; Added &lt;code&gt;recipes/minimax-m3&lt;/code&gt; — shared model-cache PVC and pinned Hugging Face download, vLLM aggregated (&lt;code&gt;agg-gb200-agentic&lt;/code&gt;, 3x TP4, 400 GB CPU KV offload per replica) and disaggregated (&lt;code&gt;disagg-gb200-agentic&lt;/code&gt;, 3 prefill + 3 decode TP4, NIXL transfer) GB200 profiles, real EAGLE3 verification by default, and a perf/trace reference (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/1cf43bce3fc865a14dcd8f9bb857f6b726617ed0/recipes/minimax-m3&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/1cf43bce3fc865a14dcd8f9bb857f6b726617ed0/recipes/minimax-m3/README.md&quot;&gt;README&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15096&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15096/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15096&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16043&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16043/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16043&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting Started&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment is Kubernetes-based (Dynamo Platform, ComputeDomain, the NVIDIA DRA driver, and &lt;code&gt;DynamoGraphDeployment&lt;/code&gt;). Full steps — namespace, &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt;, model-cache PVC, Hugging Face download of the target and EAGLE3 draft, cluster Kustomize render, DGD apply, and a &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; smoke test — are in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/1cf43bce3fc865a14dcd8f9bb857f6b726617ed0/recipes/minimax-m3/README.md&quot;&gt;recipe README&lt;/a&gt;. The token needs access to &lt;code&gt;nvidia/MiniMax-M3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Inferact/MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA&lt;/code&gt;. Recipes expect registry credentials for &lt;code&gt;nvcr.io&lt;/code&gt; and a Hugging Face token secret named &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues / Limitations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimental snapshot build — not QA-gated; not for production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This image does not include vLLM-Omni.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recipes in this build are vLLM on GB200 only.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disaggregated workers must share a compatible NVLink domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The synthetic-acceptance benchmark option bypasses real EAGLE3 verification. Use it only for controlled performance experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>nv-nmailhot</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219894992?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2</id>
    <updated>2026-10-08T23:42:32Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2&lt;/strong&gt; is an experimental snapshot build with early &lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/strong&gt; support on the Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt; backend. It is &lt;strong&gt;not recommended for production&lt;/strong&gt; and is not a QA-gated release. APIs, behavior, and defaults may change before stable support. Use it for evaluation, testing, and early feedback only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2 adds serving for &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;. The published container is built from multi-arch &lt;code&gt;vllm/vllm-openai:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt; (CUDA 13.0.2, source &lt;code&gt;db9527a46873454610df6dbedf79a36d6bf1a7f6&lt;/code&gt;) and carries NIXL transfer patches that advance the connector protocol to 14. vLLM Omni is disabled in this image (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15532&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15532/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15532&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes recipes cover aggregated and 1P1D disaggregated vLLM profiles on B200, GB200, and H200. B200 and GB200 use eight GPUs with MXFP4 sparse-indexer KV, sparse-indexer logits, and &lt;code&gt;deep_gemm_mega_moe&lt;/code&gt;. H200 uses 16 GPUs for aggregated serving or eight for disaggregated serving, with CUTLASS MoE. Every vLLM profile uses expert parallelism, expert load balancing, KV-aware routing, and DSpark with three draft tokens. Disaggregated profiles transfer KV over NIXL/UCX. The shared model-cache download pins Hugging Face revision &lt;code&gt;dba1be0a40aa45a94ad051997016db3960a90277&lt;/code&gt;, and measured agentic results ship with the recipes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15941&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15941/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15941&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2&lt;/code&gt;, tip &lt;code&gt;a201d5bd608e67a3c1def7eebace3201e6de0000&lt;/code&gt; (2026-10-08)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;vllm/vllm-openai&lt;/code&gt;, digest &lt;code&gt;sha256:c1c9f6fd5c109ba7f0546a59f5b2f15fb87f64c77782e90a27b648b42a8e67c3&lt;/code&gt;), NIXL v1.3.2 (connector protocol 14)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Images&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Arch&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM (CUDA 13.0.2)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multi-arch (&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Versions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;vllm/vllm-openai:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt;, with NIXL telemetry, region-dedup, and piecewise-prefix patches&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0.2&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NIXL v1.3.2; connector protocol 14; vLLM Omni disabled&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Model&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GPU&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;MXFP4 experts; B200/GB200 sparse-indexer KV and sparse-indexer logits; H200 CUTLASS MoE&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;8x B200, 8x GB200, 16x H200 aggregated, 8x H200 disaggregated&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;deepseek_v41&lt;/code&gt; reasoning and tool-call parsers; DSpark-3; up to 1,048,576-token context; text serving&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/strong&gt; is a Mixture-of-Experts checkpoint from DeepSeek (&lt;code&gt;deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash&lt;/code&gt;). This preview serves it through Dynamo&#39;s vLLM backend, with aggregated or 1P1D disaggregated workers, DSpark speculative decoding, and KV-aware routing on B200, GB200, and H200.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Patched vLLM 0.31.0 runtime:&lt;/strong&gt; Pins the CUDA 13 vLLM runtime to multi-arch &lt;code&gt;v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt; and applies the NIXL telemetry, region-dedup, and piecewise-prefix patches so workers in this image use connector protocol 14. vLLM Omni stays disabled (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15532&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15532/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15532&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash vLLM recipes:&lt;/strong&gt; Added aggregated and 1P1D disaggregated Kustomize profiles for B200 (8 GPU), GB200 (8 GPU), and H200 (16 GPU aggregated, 8 GPU disaggregated). Profiles use expert parallelism, EPLB, KV-aware routing, and DSpark-3. Disaggregated KV transfer uses NIXL/UCX (InfiniBand on B200 and H200; one NVLink clique on GB200). Includes the shared model-cache download, agentic benchmark job, and deployment guide (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/a201d5bd608e67a3c1def7eebace3201e6de0000/recipes/deepseek-v4.1-flash&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/a201d5bd608e67a3c1def7eebace3201e6de0000/docs/fern/pages/recipes/model-recipes/deepseek-v4-1-flash.mdx&quot;&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/a201d5bd608e67a3c1def7eebace3201e6de0000/recipes/deepseek-v4.1-flash/perf/README.md&quot;&gt;benchmarks&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15941&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15941/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15941&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting Started&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment is Kubernetes-based (Dynamo Platform + &lt;code&gt;DynamoGraphDeployment&lt;/code&gt;). Full steps — namespace, model-cache PVC, Hugging Face download job pinned to revision &lt;code&gt;dba1be0a40aa45a94ad051997016db3960a90277&lt;/code&gt;, Kustomize render, DGD apply, and a &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; smoke test — are in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/a201d5bd608e67a3c1def7eebace3201e6de0000/docs/fern/pages/recipes/model-recipes/deepseek-v4-1-flash.mdx&quot;&gt;recipe docs&lt;/a&gt;. Recipes expect an &lt;code&gt;nvcr.io&lt;/code&gt; image-pull secret, a Hugging Face token secret named &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt;, and Kustomize v5.8.1. GB200 workers schedule on ARM64 nodes; B200 and H200 workers schedule on AMD64 nodes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues / Limitations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a branch-specific snapshot build, not a QA-gated stable release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workers in this runtime image use NIXL connector protocol 14. CUDA dev and local-dev images stay on protocol 13; do not mix them in one KV transfer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GB200 disaggregated workers must share one NVLink clique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;H200 disaggregated serving places prefill and decode on separate RDMA-capable nodes and selects NICs from the &lt;code&gt;rdma/ib&lt;/code&gt; device plugin. Do not set a static &lt;code&gt;UCX_NET_DEVICES&lt;/code&gt; value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B200 and GB200 disaggregated recipes still need the cluster&#39;s RDMA device and interface settings in the Kustomization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SGLang profiles in &lt;code&gt;recipes/deepseek-v4.1-flash&lt;/code&gt; still use &lt;code&gt;sglang-runtime:1.6.0-deepseek-v4.1-flash-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;. They are not served by this vLLM image.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ynpandey-nv</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20666257?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-08T20:14:58Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1&lt;/strong&gt; is an experimental snapshot build with &lt;strong&gt;Kimi-K3&lt;/strong&gt; support on the Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt; backend. It is &lt;strong&gt;not recommended for production&lt;/strong&gt; and is not a QA-gated release. APIs, behavior, and defaults may change before stable support. Use it for evaluation, testing, and early feedback only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1 serves &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;moonshotai/Kimi-K3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; from an SGLang runtime built on Dynamo 1.5.1 and SGLang &lt;code&gt;v0.5.18&lt;/code&gt;. The image includes the two Kimi-K3 fixes that base still needs: DCP prefill/decode with DSpark draft-KV transfer, and the SM100 MoonViT cuDNN guard for image encode (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15657&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15657/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15657&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GB300 SGLang recipes run that image. Aggregated serving uses two workers (16x GB300, DCP8 attention, TP8 MoE) with load-aware routing and DSpark. Disaggregated serving is 1P1D (16x GB300; prefill TEP8, decode DCP8 attention and TEP8 MoE) with Mooncake KV transfer over NVLink. Workers set &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_FORCE_COARSE_WAR_BARRIER=1&lt;/code&gt;. The recipe includes a shared model cache and an AIPerf replay of the 64K-ISL / 400-OSL / 90% KV-reuse agentic trace (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15658&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15658/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15658&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15919&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15919/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15919&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.5.0-kimi-k3-post.1&lt;/code&gt;, tip &lt;code&gt;a0dcfbf6d3aa788e8dba806189f1611d9293a52f&lt;/code&gt; (2026-10-08)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SGLang image commit&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;22031aba1fb33524370a26150e9fd7a7751d9fef&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;release/1.5.1-kimi-k3-post.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;lmsysorg/sglang:v0.5.18-cu130-runtime&lt;/code&gt; (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Images&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Arch&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;SGLang (CUDA 13)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multi-arch (&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;arm64&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/sglang-runtime:1.5.1-kimi-k3-post.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Versions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;SGLang&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;lmsysorg/sglang:v0.5.18-cu130-runtime&lt;/code&gt; with the Kimi-K3 DCP/DSpark and SM100 MoonViT patches&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Disaggregated KV transfer uses Mooncake; DSpark draft is &lt;code&gt;RadixArk/Kimi-K3-DSpark&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Model&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GPU&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;moonshotai/Kimi-K3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;MXFP4 experts, FP8 KV cache&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GB300&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;multimodal (text + image) MoE, up to 1M-token context; &lt;code&gt;kimi_k3&lt;/code&gt; reasoning and tool-call parsers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kimi-K3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/moonshotai/Kimi-K3&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Kimi-K3&lt;/a&gt; is Moonshot AI&#39;s hybrid-attention mixture-of-experts model with multimodal (text + image) support and up to 1M-token context. This preview serves it through Dynamo&#39;s SGLang backend with aggregated and 1P1D disaggregated agentic recipes on GB300, using DSpark speculative decoding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kimi-K3 runtime on SGLang v0.5.18:&lt;/strong&gt; The published runtime is Dynamo 1.5.1 SGLang with two baked-in fixes: DCP prefill/decode plus DSpark draft-KV transfer, and a MoonViT cuDNN guard so SM100 image encode does not crash. The image build checks the patched files against the benchmarked hashes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15657&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15657/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15657&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GB300 SGLang recipes on the post.1 image:&lt;/strong&gt; Aggregated serving is two TP8/DCP8 workers (16x GB300) with load-aware routing, prefix caching, and DSpark. Disaggregated serving is 1P1D (16x GB300) with Mooncake KV transfer over MNNVL and the same DSpark draft. Workers set &lt;code&gt;SGLANG_FORCE_COARSE_WAR_BARRIER=1&lt;/code&gt;. Context length is 1,048,576. The perf job replays the agentic Mooncake trace; the published GB300 figures use synthetic acceptance length 4.05 (aggregated: 91.3 output tok/s/GPU, 55.6 user tok/s P50, TTFT P50 486 ms at concurrency 36; 1P1D: 62.0 output tok/s/GPU, 77.6 user tok/s P50, TTFT P50 4,793 ms at concurrency 18) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/a0dcfbf6d3aa788e8dba806189f1611d9293a52f/recipes/kimi-k3&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/a0dcfbf6d3aa788e8dba806189f1611d9293a52f/docs/fern/pages/recipes/model-recipes/kimi-k3.mdx&quot;&gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15658&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15658/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15658&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15919&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15919/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15919&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting Started&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment is Kubernetes-based (Dynamo Platform + &lt;code&gt;DynamoGraphDeployment&lt;/code&gt;). Use the GB300 SGLang manifests under &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/a0dcfbf6d3aa788e8dba806189f1611d9293a52f/recipes/kimi-k3/sglang&quot;&gt;recipes/kimi-k3/sglang&lt;/a&gt;: create the namespace, Hugging Face token secret &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;nvcr.io&lt;/code&gt; pull secret, populate the shared model cache, apply the aggregated or disaggregated manifest, and smoke-test &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; with model &lt;code&gt;moonshotai/Kimi-K3&lt;/code&gt;. Benchmark steps are in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/a0dcfbf6d3aa788e8dba806189f1611d9293a52f/recipes/kimi-k3/perf/README.md&quot;&gt;perf README&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues / Limitations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a branch-specific snapshot build, not a QA-gated stable release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This snapshot publishes an SGLang image only. vLLM manifests on the branch still reference &lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.4.0-kimi-k3-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SGLang manifests on this branch are GB300-only (aggregated 16x and disaggregated 1P1D 16x). There is no H200 SGLang profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The GB300 tok/s figures above use synthetic speculative acceptance (&lt;code&gt;acc_len&lt;/code&gt; 4.05). They are not real DSpark verification results. The serving manifests default to real DSpark; synthetic acceptance is a benchmark-only setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;During a long prefill, the canary health check (&lt;code&gt;DYN_HEALTH_CHECK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT&lt;/code&gt;, 3 seconds) can fail and Kubernetes can restart a busy worker. If the worker log shows &lt;code&gt;Health check timeout for&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;generate&lt;/code&gt;, set &lt;code&gt;DYN_HEALTH_CHECK_ENABLED=false&lt;/code&gt; on each SGLang worker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requests containing &lt;code&gt;logprobs&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;stop_token_ids&lt;/code&gt; are not supported and may cause disaggregated recipes to crash or enter a bad state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With JSON structured decoding, output for non-object top-level items can appear in &lt;code&gt;reasoning_content&lt;/code&gt; instead of &lt;code&gt;content&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ynpandey-nv</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20666257?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.5.1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-07T01:54:13Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.1"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.5.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.5.1 - Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.5.1 is a patch release on top of &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.0&quot;&gt;v1.5.0&lt;/a&gt;. It fixes &lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Router overload recovery&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;min_tokens&lt;/code&gt; on tokenizer-free SGLang decode workers&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Qwen3-VL video routing across mixed workers&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;reinforcement learning worker discovery on Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;. It bounds &lt;strong&gt;client-supplied multimodal input&lt;/strong&gt; (inline &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt; URL size, remote media downloads, image dimensions, and base64 audio) across the SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, vLLM, and vLLM-Omni paths, and moves all media fetching onto a single aiohttp client. It also upgrades the frontend runtime libraries to fix &lt;strong&gt;Anthropic Messages API requests from Claude Code&lt;/strong&gt; against strict chat templates, moves ModelExpress to v0.6.0, pins PyNvVideoCodec at 2.2.3, and moves the in-tree FFmpeg build to 9.0.1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two changes need action on upgrade. See &lt;strong&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.5.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Egress Proxy Opt-In:&lt;/strong&gt; Workers that fetch request media through an ambient HTTP proxy must now set &lt;code&gt;DYN_MM_TRUST_EGRESS_PROXY=1&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14474&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14474/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14474&lt;/a&gt;). Without it, a policy-checked media fetch that would route through a proxy is refused, because the proxy resolves the destination outside Dynamo&#39;s address check. Fetches that go direct, including hosts listed in &lt;code&gt;NO_PROXY&lt;/code&gt;, are unaffected, and the check does not run under &lt;code&gt;DYN_MM_ALLOW_INTERNAL=1&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Diffusion Local References:&lt;/strong&gt; Local image and video files passed as &lt;code&gt;input_reference&lt;/code&gt; to SGLang image-diffusion and video-generation workers now require &lt;code&gt;DYN_MM_LOCAL_PATH&lt;/code&gt; to name the allowed directory (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14435&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14435/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14435&lt;/a&gt;). Previously any local path was accepted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Router Overload Hint Expiry:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed a Dynamo Router condition where a worker that rejected requests for lack of capacity stayed marked overloaded after the pressure ended, so clients kept receiving HTTP 529 from an idle worker (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5327287390&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14210&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14210/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14210&quot;&gt;#14210&lt;/a&gt;). Overload hints raised on the request path now expire after one second, while overload state reported by the worker monitor stays independent, so a drained worker returns to rotation without a restart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Tokenizer-Free Min Tokens:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed requests with a positive &lt;code&gt;min_tokens&lt;/code&gt; failing on SGLang decode workers started with &lt;code&gt;skip_tokenizer_init&lt;/code&gt;, where SGLang rejects the &lt;code&gt;min_new_tokens&lt;/code&gt; field (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5340230535&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14276&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14276/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14276&quot;&gt;#14276&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo now enforces the minimum itself on that path, and cancellation or early stream closure aborts every unfinished choice in multi-choice (&lt;code&gt;n&lt;/code&gt;) requests. Requests without &lt;code&gt;min_tokens&lt;/code&gt; and workers that keep a tokenizer are unchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Split Stop-Sequence Leak:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed hidden stop sequences that arrive split across several decode steps leaking their leading fragments into client output (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5358967864&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14378&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14378/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14378&quot;&gt;#14378&lt;/a&gt;). The decoder now holds back text that could still complete a stop sequence and releases it only once it cannot match, or when the engine finishes on its own, for example at &lt;code&gt;max_tokens&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qwen3-VL Video Contract Agreement:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed a Qwen3-VL deployment serving video with a prompt-expansion contract that only some of its workers publish (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5415309304&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14624&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14624/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14624&quot;&gt;#14624&lt;/a&gt;). Replicas with different installed packages or engine flags can publish different video contracts; when the workers in a group disagree, Dynamo now disables exact video routing for that group while text serving continues, and keeps the existing group serving until a rebuilt one commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sidecar Worker Namespace Suffix:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed vLLM sidecar and mocker workers registering under the base namespace while reinforcement learning discovery on Kubernetes searched the suffixed one, so RL workloads could not find their workers (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5479327786&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14955&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14955/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14955&quot;&gt;#14955&lt;/a&gt;). Worker registration now applies &lt;code&gt;DYN_NAMESPACE_WORKER_SUFFIX&lt;/code&gt; at most once, which keeps operator-upgraded workloads whose &lt;code&gt;DYN_NAMESPACE&lt;/code&gt; already carries the suffix working, and an explicit command-line namespace still takes precedence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GPU Memory Service Admission Timeout:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed the vLLM GPU Memory Service worker ignoring a configured &lt;code&gt;gms_ro_connect_timeout_ms&lt;/code&gt; during its initial weights load, which could leave startup waiting indefinitely behind lock contention (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5466750118&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14877&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14877/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14877&quot;&gt;#14877&lt;/a&gt;). Deployments that do not set the timeout keep the existing unbounded wait.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inline Data URL Size Cap:&lt;/strong&gt; Added a size cap on inline &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt; media URLs, enforced by both the frontend and the workers (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5380397334&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14437&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14437/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14437&quot;&gt;#14437&lt;/a&gt;). A &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt; URL larger than &lt;code&gt;DYN_MM_MAX_DATA_URL_MB&lt;/code&gt; (default 16 MiB) now returns HTTP 400 with a message naming the variable, where before any size was accepted. To raise the limit, set the variable on both the frontend and the workers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Diffusion Input References:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed SGLang image-diffusion and video-generation workers handing a client-supplied &lt;code&gt;input_reference&lt;/code&gt; to the generator after only a non-empty check (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5380322309&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14435&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14435/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14435&quot;&gt;#14435&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo now validates the reference and downloads a remote one to a temporary local file first, capped by &lt;code&gt;DYN_MM_MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB&lt;/code&gt; (default 64 MiB), which matches the vLLM-Omni and TensorRT-LLM workers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM-Omni Input Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed non-numeric or out-of-range image &lt;code&gt;width&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;height&lt;/code&gt; values and malformed base64 audio crashing the vLLM-Omni worker or ending a realtime session (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5380375531&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14436&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14436/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14436&quot;&gt;#14436&lt;/a&gt;). Image dimensions outside 1 to 4096 are now rejected with a clear error, an unusable realtime audio chunk emits an &lt;code&gt;invalid_audio&lt;/code&gt; error event instead of closing the connection, and percent-encoded &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt; reference audio for text-to-speech now decodes correctly instead of producing corrupted audio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Fetch Address Pinning:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed media fetches resolving a hostname once to validate it and again to connect, so a server that answered differently the second time was checked on one address and dialed on another (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5388237207&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14474&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14474/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14474&quot;&gt;#14474&lt;/a&gt;). The Python workers and the Rust frontend now connect only to the addresses that passed validation, while TLS still verifies the original hostname.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Single aiohttp HTTP Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Removed the opt-in httpx backend from Dynamo&#39;s HTTP client, leaving aiohttp as the only backend (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5405531726&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14563&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14563/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14563&quot;&gt;#14563&lt;/a&gt;). Setting &lt;code&gt;DYN_HTTP_BACKEND=httpx&lt;/code&gt; now logs a warning and uses aiohttp. The TensorRT-LLM multimodal processor&#39;s remote &lt;code&gt;.safetensors&lt;/code&gt; download now streams asynchronously, so it no longer blocks the event loop for up to the 300-second download timeout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dependency Changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Runtime Libraries:&lt;/strong&gt; Upgraded &lt;code&gt;dynamo-renderer&lt;/code&gt; to v5.1.2 and &lt;code&gt;dynamo-tokenizers&lt;/code&gt; to v1.8.1, fixing Anthropic Messages API failures when Claude Code sends a non-leading system message to a model whose chat template requires system content first (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5406732075&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14595&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14595/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14595&quot;&gt;#14595&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek V4 Reasoning Effort:&lt;/strong&gt; The renderer now defaults an omitted or invalid reasoning effort to &lt;code&gt;high&lt;/code&gt;, treats &lt;code&gt;none&lt;/code&gt; as thinking disabled, and lets a top-level &lt;code&gt;reasoning_effort&lt;/code&gt; override the template argument (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5406732075&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14595&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14595/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14595&quot;&gt;#14595&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenAI Response Fields:&lt;/strong&gt; Upgraded &lt;code&gt;dynamo-protocols&lt;/code&gt; to v5.4.1, so &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; responses omit absent optional fields such as &lt;code&gt;usage&lt;/code&gt; instead of returning &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5318628594&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14154&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14154/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14154&quot;&gt;#14154&lt;/a&gt;). Client code that indexes raw response dictionaries should check for those keys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ModelExpress:&lt;/strong&gt; Upgraded ModelExpress to v0.6.0 in the SGLang and vLLM runtime images (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5493386742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15026&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15026/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15026&quot;&gt;#15026&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PyNvVideoCodec and FFmpeg:&lt;/strong&gt; Pinned PyNvVideoCodec at 2.2.3 in the runtime images and moved the in-tree FFmpeg build to 9.0.1 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5470819217&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14925&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14925/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14925&quot;&gt;#14925&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend aiohttp:&lt;/strong&gt; Raised aiohttp in the Frontend image to 3.14.4, matching the other images (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5719493506&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15676&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15676/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15676&quot;&gt;#15676&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migration After Shutdown Grace:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarified across the fault-tolerance guides that requests can finish during the shutdown grace period, that unfinished requests are cancelled when it expires, and that they can migrate to another worker when migration is enabled and the request allows it, with configuration guidance for rolling upgrades and scale-downs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5466311140&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14872&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14872/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14872&quot;&gt;#14872&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stale Documentation Links:&lt;/strong&gt; Repaired documentation links that pointed at moved pages on &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; and returned 404 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5613334124&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/15308&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15308/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15308&quot;&gt;#15308&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Skills Tab:&lt;/strong&gt; Moved Agent Skills from a single Reference page into its own documentation tab, with an overview and one page per skill category, and listed all 27 skills (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5317974399&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14146&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14146/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14146&quot;&gt;#14146&lt;/a&gt;). The old Reference URL redirects to the new overview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Dependencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backend runtime versions are unchanged from v1.5.0:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NIXL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UCX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;v1.5.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.5.18&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v1.3.0rc25&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.28.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v1.4.0&lt;/code&gt; (SGLang) / &lt;code&gt;v1.3.1&lt;/code&gt; (TensorRT-LLM) / &lt;code&gt;v1.3.2&lt;/code&gt; (vLLM)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v1.21.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CUDA Variants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TensorRT-LLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.1&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AIPerf&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AISimulate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ModelExpress&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM-Omni&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.12.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.12.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.6.0&lt;/code&gt; (from &lt;code&gt;v0.5.0&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;v0.28.0rc1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SGLang Sidecar Inference 500 Errors:&lt;/strong&gt; Every inference request sent to the SGLang sidecar still fails with HTTP 500 and the error &lt;code&gt;&#39;GenerateReqInput&#39; object has no attribute &#39;batch_size&#39;&lt;/code&gt;. The cause is a protocol mismatch with the bundled SGLang version that is corrected in upstream SGLang v0.5.19. No workaround is available yet; the fix is targeted for v1.6.0.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video Decode Worker Crash:&lt;/strong&gt; Some H.264 videos sent as multimodal input crash the worker serving the request when PyNvVideoCodec 2.2.3 decodes the final frame, and later requests to that worker fail until it restarts. The issue also affects v1.5.0 on SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, and vLLM. Image and audio inputs are not affected. No workaround is available yet; the fix is targeted for v1.6.0.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Carried forward from v1.5.0:&lt;/strong&gt; The other known issues documented in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.0&quot;&gt;v1.5.0 release notes&lt;/a&gt; still apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>dagil-nvidia</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221734541?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1</id>
    <updated>2026-10-02T00:11:20Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1&lt;/strong&gt; is an experimental snapshot build with early &lt;strong&gt;Motif-3 NVFP4&lt;/strong&gt; support on the Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt; backend. It is &lt;strong&gt;not recommended for production&lt;/strong&gt; and is not a QA-gated release. APIs, behavior, and defaults may change before stable support. Use it for evaluation, testing, and early feedback only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1 serves &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Motif-Technologies/Motif-3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on Dynamo &lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;. The runtime image is an amd64 CUDA 13.0 build on Motif&#39;s vLLM &lt;code&gt;v0.26.0-motif3&lt;/code&gt; base, with vLLM-Omni disabled so that base can serve without &lt;code&gt;vllm-rs&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15332&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15332/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15332&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Kubernetes recipe is aggregated-only: two B200 GPUs, tensor parallelism 2, expert parallelism, Dynamo MTP2 speculative decoding, an FP8 KV cache, and a 262,144-token context. It includes a shared model-cache PVC and Hugging Face download Job, plus an AIPerf &lt;code&gt;0.13.0&lt;/code&gt; chat-trace Job at concurrency 11. The recipe from &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15534&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15534/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15534&lt;/a&gt; is on this branch in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15536&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15536/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15536&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/0d8bafd1c22248341dceb07b9a3f586f1f208651/recipes/motif-3&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.5.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Base Commit&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;f5802d355b59b5006c67a16c3ed1615cfcab5686&lt;/code&gt; (2026-08-18)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Preview Branch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;release/1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Preview Tip&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;0d8bafd1c22248341dceb07b9a3f586f1f208651&lt;/code&gt; (2026-10-01)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;vLLM&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;ghcr.io/motiftechnologies/vllm:v0.26.0-motif3@sha256:c90d471174ec29a0f6c5ecba718a6905a4180be72f2c6d37ce9dad4d799fa836&lt;/code&gt; (CUDA 13.0), NIXL v1.3.2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Container Images&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Arch&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;amd64&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.5.0-motif-3-dev.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Versions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;vLLM&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Dynamo-built runtime on &lt;code&gt;ghcr.io/motiftechnologies/vllm:v0.26.0-motif3@sha256:c90d471174ec29a0f6c5ecba718a6905a4180be72f2c6d37ce9dad4d799fa836&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;13.0&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3.12&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NIXL v1.3.2; vLLM-Omni disabled; amd64 only&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Model&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;GPU&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Motif-Technologies/Motif-3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;NVFP4 (&lt;code&gt;modelopt_nvfp4&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;2x B200&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;aggregated vLLM; TP2, expert parallelism, Dynamo MTP2, FP8 KV cache, 262K context&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Motif-3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motif-3 NVFP4&lt;/strong&gt; is Motif Technologies&#39; preview checkpoint published on Hugging Face as &lt;code&gt;Motif-Technologies/Motif-3-NVFP4&lt;/code&gt;. This build serves it through Dynamo&#39;s vLLM backend as an aggregated two-GPU B200 deployment with MTP2 speculative decoding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;vLLM Backend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motif vLLM runtime:&lt;/strong&gt; amd64 Dynamo vLLM runtime on Motif&#39;s &lt;code&gt;v0.26.0-motif3&lt;/code&gt; image, with vLLM-Omni disabled so the Motif base can serve without &lt;code&gt;vllm-rs&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15332&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15332/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15332&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motif-3 NVFP4 recipe:&lt;/strong&gt; Added &lt;code&gt;recipes/motif-3&lt;/code&gt; — shared model-cache PVC and Hugging Face download Job, one aggregated B200 chat profile (TP2, expert parallelism, Dynamo MTP2, FP8 KV cache, 262K context), and an AIPerf &lt;code&gt;0.13.0&lt;/code&gt; chat-trace Job at concurrency 11 (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/tree/0d8bafd1c22248341dceb07b9a3f586f1f208651/recipes/motif-3&quot;&gt;recipe folder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/0d8bafd1c22248341dceb07b9a3f586f1f208651/recipes/motif-3/README.md&quot;&gt;README&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15536&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15536/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15536&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15534&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/15534/hovercard&quot;&gt;#15534&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting Started&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment is Kubernetes-based (Dynamo Platform + &lt;code&gt;DynamoGraphDeployment&lt;/code&gt;). Full steps — namespace, &lt;code&gt;hf-token-secret&lt;/code&gt;, model-cache PVC, download Job, aggregated DGD apply, and a &lt;code&gt;/v1/chat/completions&lt;/code&gt; smoke test — are in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/0d8bafd1c22248341dceb07b9a3f586f1f208651/recipes/motif-3/README.md&quot;&gt;recipe README&lt;/a&gt;. The base manifest has no cluster-specific scheduling; use the Kustomization in that folder to add node selectors or tolerations. The download Job is the only step that needs the Hugging Face token. No image-pull secret is required for the public runtime image.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Known Issues / Limitations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimental snapshot build — not QA-gated; not for production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aggregated serving only. There is no disaggregated Motif-3 profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The vLLM runtime image is amd64 only, and the recipe references it by tag rather than digest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The runtime image carries Motif-specific vLLM compatibility code. Do not replace its vLLM package with an unrelated wheel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped manifests use real MTP verification. Figures measured with synthetic acceptance length 2.13 are a benchmark-only proxy and are not reproduced by the manifests as shipped. A real-MTP chat-trace result is not attached.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the reference 8K/1K chat trace, 35 requests exceed the 262,144-token context limit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>ynpandey-nv</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20666257?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/942206898/v1.5.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-09T09:25:35Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/releases/tag/v1.5.0"/>
    <title>Dynamo v1.5.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0 - Release Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo v1.5.0 is the 18th feature release of the open-source distributed inference platform, spanning 658 merged PRs from 123 contributors. It opens &lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Router&lt;/strong&gt; worker selection to custom scoring and picking policies and extends KV indexing to Mooncake and disk tiers. KVBM is deprecated, with removal targeted for v1.7.0. &lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Frontend&lt;/strong&gt; streams guided tool calls by default and rejects over-context requests before the first token, and multimodal encode-prefill-decode deployments can decode images once at the Frontend. On Kubernetes, &lt;code&gt;nvidia.com/v1beta1&lt;/code&gt; becomes the CRD storage version, the Rust Endpoint Picker replaces the Go EPP, and Dynamo Snapshot moves to a standalone operator. TLS and mutual TLS now cover the TCP and NATS transports. AIConfigurator becomes &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/aisimulate&quot;&gt;AISimulate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; and ships as its own package, and the engines move to SGLang v0.5.18, TensorRT-LLM v1.3.0rc25, and vLLM v0.28.0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Router: Custom Selection Policies &amp;amp; Tiered KV Indexing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Worker selection is now pluggable. Native scorer and picker policies run through the same host selection path as the built-in selector, so discovery, eligibility, reservations, metrics, and dispatch stay in Dynamo while the policy decides which worker wins (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5034612366&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12526&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12526/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12526&quot;&gt;#12526&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5053361056&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12585&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12585/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12585&quot;&gt;#12585&lt;/a&gt;). Composable worker filters run after built-in eligibility and before scoring (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5099755492&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12896&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12896/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12896&quot;&gt;#12896&lt;/a&gt;), and session affinity comes in hard and soft forms (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5269169796&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13907&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13907/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13907&quot;&gt;#13907&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the indexing side, Dynamo Router consumes Mooncake shared-cache events for SGLang HiCache without HTTP queries on the hot path (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4820552763&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11239&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11239/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11239&quot;&gt;#11239&lt;/a&gt;) and routes vLLM storage KV events to a disk tier with locality gating (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4861499263&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11571&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11571/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11571&quot;&gt;#11571&lt;/a&gt;). A conditional disaggregation bypass sends short requests straight to decode (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4895174499&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11723&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11723/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11723&quot;&gt;#11723&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4895289209&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11725&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11725/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11725&quot;&gt;#11725&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamo Frontend: Guided Tool Calls, Thinking Controls &amp;amp; Request Validation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided tool calls stream incrementally by default, and Qwen3 joins the v2 unified tool-call parser (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5052173675&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12576&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12576/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12576&quot;&gt;#12576&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5166716365&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13340&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13340/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13340&quot;&gt;#13340&lt;/a&gt;). Thinking and reasoning controls resolve once with a single precedence and apply to every chat-template key, with deployment-level defaults and an explicit &lt;code&gt;enable_thinking&lt;/code&gt; gate for Gemma 4 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4770061406&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11047&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11047/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11047&quot;&gt;#11047&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4897108181&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11739&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11739/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11739&quot;&gt;#11739&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5125719985&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13061/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13061&quot;&gt;#13061&lt;/a&gt;). Bad requests now fail with the right status: over-context requests are rejected before the stream opens, validation failures return HTTP 400, and backend overloads keep their 503 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4964045187&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12092&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12092/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12092&quot;&gt;#12092&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4973439786&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12155&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12155/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12155&quot;&gt;#12155&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5015537373&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12412&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12412/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12412&quot;&gt;#12412&lt;/a&gt;). The Frontend loads pluggable tokenizer backends, including one from Baseten, with a configurable Hugging Face fallback (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5012591810&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12376&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12376/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12376&quot;&gt;#12376&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5107243856&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12923&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12923/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12923&quot;&gt;#12923&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multimodal: Frontend Image Decoding, Video-Aware Routing &amp;amp; Omni Realtime Audio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Encode-prefill-decode deployments on SGLang and vLLM can decode images once at Dynamo Frontend, now on libjpeg-turbo and FFmpeg, and hand pixels to the encode worker over a single NIXL transfer (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4921632100&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11880&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11880/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11880&quot;&gt;#11880&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4946699703&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12004&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12004/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12004&quot;&gt;#12004&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4790534607&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11157&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11157/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11157&quot;&gt;#11157&lt;/a&gt;). Qwen video inputs route with video-aware KV hashing, and vLLM workers accept audio and video inputs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5330940598&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14239&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14239/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14239&quot;&gt;#14239&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5236567546&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13717&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13717/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13717&quot;&gt;#13717&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4991302085&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12214&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12214/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12214&quot;&gt;#12214&lt;/a&gt;). vLLM-Omni adds realtime audio streaming and dynamic LoRA for aggregated workers (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4969088111&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12100&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12100/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12100&quot;&gt;#12100&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4858885904&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11551&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11551/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11551&quot;&gt;#11551&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes: v1beta1 Storage, Rust EPP, Standalone Snapshot &amp;amp; GMS V1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;nvidia.com/v1beta1&lt;/code&gt; is the CRD storage version, the version the API server persists, and the published examples drop their v1alpha1 copies (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4927699319&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11904&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11904/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11904&quot;&gt;#11904&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4795067501&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11177&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11177/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11177&quot;&gt;#11177&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5012504218&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12375&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12375/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12375&quot;&gt;#12375&lt;/a&gt;). The Go Endpoint Picker is removed and the Rust EPP is the default. It ships inside the Dynamo Frontend image, with a standalone image planned (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4832049685&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11355&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11355/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11355&quot;&gt;#11355&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4915809730&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11868&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11868/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11868&quot;&gt;#11868&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5075350430&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12720&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12720/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12720&quot;&gt;#12720&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5192054380&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13537&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13537/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13537&quot;&gt;#13537&lt;/a&gt;). An llm-d batch gateway example brings offline OpenAI Batch requests through the inference gateway, with dispatch gated on Dynamo readiness (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5085221338&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12784&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12784/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12784&quot;&gt;#12784&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5281440584&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13978&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13978/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13978&quot;&gt;#13978&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/snapshot&quot;&gt;Dynamo Snapshot&lt;/a&gt; moves to a standalone operator and chart, Snapshot v0.1.0, with &lt;code&gt;PodSnapshot&lt;/code&gt; CRDs replacing the removed &lt;code&gt;DynamoCheckpoint&lt;/code&gt; CRD. Install it separately for production, or let the platform chart pull it in with &lt;code&gt;global.snapshot.install=true&lt;/code&gt; for evaluation (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5142245456&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13177&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13177/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13177&quot;&gt;#13177&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5180782231&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13452&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13452/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13452&quot;&gt;#13452&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5304676661&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14076&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14076/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14076&quot;&gt;#14076&lt;/a&gt;). The experimental GPU Memory Service V1 brings a checkpoint lifecycle and engine integration for SGLang and vLLM (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5146303332&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13218&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13218/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13218&quot;&gt;#13218&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5451676984&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14797&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14797/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14797&quot;&gt;#14797&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5354172229&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14360&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14360/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14360&quot;&gt;#14360&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5067216987&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12685&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12685/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12685&quot;&gt;#12685&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo Operator adds &lt;code&gt;runtimeVersionOverride&lt;/code&gt;, runtime feature gates, explicit multinode component roles, and default worker canary health checks (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4623269511&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/10494&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/10494/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/10494&quot;&gt;#10494&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5017816229&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12421&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12421/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12421&quot;&gt;#12421&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5374820746&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14419&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14419/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14419&quot;&gt;#14419&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4774688883&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11083&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11083/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11083&quot;&gt;#11083&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Reliability: Request Migration, Readiness &amp;amp; Tracing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Request migration attempts and cancellations are traced end to end (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4788635954&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11133&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11133/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11133&quot;&gt;#11133&lt;/a&gt;), and request-trace records write to a native S3 sink (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4906431424&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/11806&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11806/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11806&quot;&gt;#11806&lt;/a&gt;). A model readiness metric gates batch dispatch (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5281341558&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13976&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13976/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13976&quot;&gt;#13976&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5281440584&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13978&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13978/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13978&quot;&gt;#13978&lt;/a&gt;), and worker liveness probes tolerate three failures instead of one (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5188248452&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13512&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13512/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13512&quot;&gt;#13512&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Modeling: AISimulate, Formerly AIConfigurator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AIConfigurator is now &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/aisimulate&quot;&gt;AISimulate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. It ships as its own package at v0.12.0 with one CLI, replacing the aiconfigurator wheels and the &lt;code&gt;dynamo.replay&lt;/code&gt; entrypoint (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5219117131&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13665&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13665/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13665&quot;&gt;#13665&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5184510788&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13478&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13478/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13478&quot;&gt;#13478&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5465590831&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14867&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14867/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14867&quot;&gt;#14867&lt;/a&gt;). Offline replay returns a single &lt;code&gt;ReplayReport&lt;/code&gt;, with per-request capture opt-in (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5011206538&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12363&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12363/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12363&quot;&gt;#12363&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New recipes cover Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B FP8 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5132822184&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13105&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13105/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13105&quot;&gt;#13105&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5154009673&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13265&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13265/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13265&quot;&gt;#13265&lt;/a&gt;), Qwen3.5-122B FP8 on H200 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4963316694&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12088&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12088/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12088&quot;&gt;#12088&lt;/a&gt;), Nemotron-3.5-Lightning (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5120837948&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13021&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13021/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13021&quot;&gt;#13021&lt;/a&gt;), a Nemotron-3-Ultra refresh (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5146636413&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13226&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13226/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13226&quot;&gt;#13226&lt;/a&gt;), and GLM-5.3-Flash on vLLM (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5264937906&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13899&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13899/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13899&quot;&gt;#13899&lt;/a&gt;). DeepSeek-V4 downloads are parameterized by checkpoint (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5123531933&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13034&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13034/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13034&quot;&gt;#13034&lt;/a&gt;). The DeepSeek-V3.2 FP4 and Llama-3-70B recipes are removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5218868989&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13663&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13663/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13663&quot;&gt;#13663&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security: Transport Encryption, Certificate Injection &amp;amp; Fail-Closed Paths&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TLS now covers the TCP request and response planes and the NATS transport, with mutual TLS available on both, all opt-in (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4734462081&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/10921&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/10921/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/10921&quot;&gt;#10921&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5037852043&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12533&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12533/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12533&quot;&gt;#12533&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5130308491&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13096&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13096/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13096&quot;&gt;#13096&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5191137926&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13528&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13528/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13528&quot;&gt;#13528&lt;/a&gt;). Dynamo Operator injects the certificate paths once through &lt;code&gt;InfrastructureConfiguration&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5226152962&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13689&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13689/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13689&quot;&gt;#13689&lt;/a&gt;), and administrative routes on the Backend SDK are gated on the worker lifecycle (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5153755273&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13259&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13259/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13259&quot;&gt;#13259&lt;/a&gt;). Request handling fails closed: unservable requests get a typed 4xx before the stream opens (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4964045187&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12092&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12092/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12092&quot;&gt;#12092&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5385459111&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14467&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14467/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14467&quot;&gt;#14467&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5114149060&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12966&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12966/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12966&quot;&gt;#12966&lt;/a&gt;), and unknown &lt;code&gt;tool_call_parser&lt;/code&gt; names are refused at registration (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5257003427&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13828&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13828/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13828&quot;&gt;#13828&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimental: Dynamo Sidecar, Triton Backend &amp;amp; SGLang RL Rollout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo Sidecar, the Triton backend, and the SGLang RL rollout contract are experimental in v1.5.0. Interfaces, defaults, and image layout may change without a deprecation cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dynamo Sidecar runs beside a stock inference engine and integrates over the engine&#39;s native gRPC API, so the engine keeps its own serve command and Dynamo stays in a separate process. SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, and vLLM each get a wheel-installed launcher, and all three sidecars ship in one CPU-only multi-arch image (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5272051895&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13923&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13923/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13923&quot;&gt;#13923&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5239702862&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13735&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13735/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13735&quot;&gt;#13735&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5272274943&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13929&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13929/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13929&quot;&gt;#13929&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5272084487&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13924&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13924/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13924&quot;&gt;#13924&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5250127311&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13781&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13781/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13781&quot;&gt;#13781&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5271507664&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13917&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13917/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13917&quot;&gt;#13917&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;dynamo.triton&lt;/code&gt; backend brings non-LLM model serving into a Dynamo pipeline. Vision, embedding, and other tensor-in, tensor-out models that already run on NVIDIA Triton can sit behind Dynamo Frontend and its routing alongside the LLM workers, launched the same way as every other runtime with &lt;code&gt;python -m dynamo.triton&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5249159162&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13774&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13774/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13774&quot;&gt;#13774&lt;/a&gt;). No prebuilt image ships for it, so build it from the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/blob/release/1.5.0/container/templates/triton_runtime.Dockerfile&quot;&gt;Triton runtime Dockerfile&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An experimental SGLang reinforcement learning rollout contract rounds out the section: detailed finish reasons, prompt token ids and logprobs in &lt;code&gt;nvext&lt;/code&gt;, native pause controls, and exact stop-token output, exercised by a Slime example (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5215232680&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13640&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13640/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13640&quot;&gt;#13640&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5395157775&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14525&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14525/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14525&quot;&gt;#14525&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5273703377&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/13951&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13951/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13951&quot;&gt;#13951&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5345872681&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/14317&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14317/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14317&quot;&gt;#14317&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5094263529&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12856/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12856&quot;&gt;#12856&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open-Source Contributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Between v1.4.2 and v1.5.0 the project merged 658 PRs from 123 contributors, 40 of them from outside NVIDIA. Thank you to the external community contributors in this release (organization identified through the commit-author email domain or the public GitHub profile):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DaoCloud:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/bzsuni&quot;&gt;@bzsuni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/carlory&quot;&gt;@carlory&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/flpanbin&quot;&gt;@flpanbin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/muma378&quot;&gt;@muma378&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/panpan0000&quot;&gt;@panpan0000&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/weizhoublue&quot;&gt;@weizhoublue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/windsonsea&quot;&gt;@windsonsea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/yankay&quot;&gt;@yankay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CoreWeave:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/alexeldeib&quot;&gt;@alexeldeib&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/houshengbo&quot;&gt;@houshengbo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Rexwang8&quot;&gt;@Rexwang8&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ritazh&quot;&gt;@ritazh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intel:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Spycsh&quot;&gt;@Spycsh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tthakkal&quot;&gt;@tthakkal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/VincyZhang&quot;&gt;@VincyZhang&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aliyun:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/xianlubird&quot;&gt;@xianlubird&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amazon:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/AineshSootha&quot;&gt;@AineshSootha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jlonge4&quot;&gt;@jlonge4&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/YiqiuLiu&quot;&gt;@YiqiuLiu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arizona State University:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Change72&quot;&gt;@Change72&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baseten:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/michaelfeil&quot;&gt;@michaelfeil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shalinkpatel&quot;&gt;@shalinkpatel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/walkoss&quot;&gt;@walkoss&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gcore:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Kaonael&quot;&gt;@Kaonael&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Georgia Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Skenix64&quot;&gt;@Skenix64&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;H Company:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/h-avsha&quot;&gt;@h-avsha&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jont828&quot;&gt;@Jont828&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reflection AI:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/joeltg&quot;&gt;@joeltg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SK Telecom:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/changhyeonnam&quot;&gt;@changhyeonnam&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Jose State University:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ayaangazali&quot;&gt;@ayaangazali&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stanford University:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/merceod&quot;&gt;@merceod&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UC San Diego Hao AI Lab:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/vishruthb&quot;&gt;@vishruthb&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;University of Guelph:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mgsalem&quot;&gt;@mgsalem&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;University of Washington:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Shaoting-Feng&quot;&gt;@Shaoting-Feng&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yandex Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jellysnack&quot;&gt;@jellysnack&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/avinash-rafay&quot;&gt;@avinash-rafay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cmdy&quot;&gt;@cmdy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/elizabetht&quot;&gt;@elizabetht&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hnt2601&quot;&gt;@hnt2601&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jonny-Skelton&quot;&gt;@Jonny-Skelton&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Contributors:&lt;/strong&gt; welcome to the 23 first-time contributors in this release:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/elizabetht&quot;&gt;@elizabetht&lt;/a&gt; wrapped OTLP exporter construction in the Tokio runtime context (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11143&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11143/hovercard&quot;&gt;#11143&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/YiqiuLiu&quot;&gt;@YiqiuLiu&lt;/a&gt; added a native S3 sink for request-trace records (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11806&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11806/hovercard&quot;&gt;#11806&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/h-avsha&quot;&gt;@h-avsha&lt;/a&gt; added embedding cache metrics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11969&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11969/hovercard&quot;&gt;#11969&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/avinash-rafay&quot;&gt;@avinash-rafay&lt;/a&gt; forwarded the full request body to the EPP KV-router scorer (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11991&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/11991/hovercard&quot;&gt;#11991&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/anmolgupt&quot;&gt;@anmolgupt&lt;/a&gt; added tokenizer alignment, a multi-process pool, and worker byte transport for embedding workers (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12157&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12157/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12157&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hnt2601&quot;&gt;@hnt2601&lt;/a&gt; emitted per-chunk token usage on &lt;code&gt;/v1/messages&lt;/code&gt; streaming (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12473&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12473/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12473&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/YijiaZhao&quot;&gt;@YijiaZhao&lt;/a&gt; sampled variable-length prefill batches in the vLLM self-benchmark (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12627&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12627/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12627&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mgsalem&quot;&gt;@mgsalem&lt;/a&gt; allowed custom ServiceMonitor labels in the Helm chart (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12716&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12716/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12716&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/kristinapathak&quot;&gt;@kristinapathak&lt;/a&gt; clarified the verified CI requirement in the contributing guide (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12763&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12763/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12763&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/bzsuni&quot;&gt;@bzsuni&lt;/a&gt; fixed the Fern CLI guide link and seven more docs and CI fixes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12817&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12817/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12817&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Skenix64&quot;&gt;@Skenix64&lt;/a&gt; gated Gemma 4 reasoning on &lt;code&gt;enable_thinking&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13061/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13061&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JulienDarve&quot;&gt;@JulienDarve&lt;/a&gt; bumped vLLM to v0.27.1 and isolated the CUDA context from GPU Memory Service checks in the NVDEC tests (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13059&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13059/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13059&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13130&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13130/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13130&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/chw001&quot;&gt;@chw001&lt;/a&gt; corrected the Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-FP8 recipe model ID (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13265&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13265/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13265&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/changhyeonnam&quot;&gt;@changhyeonnam&lt;/a&gt; regenerated the Kustomize OpenAPI schema after the PodSnapshot change (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13444&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13444/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13444&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ayaangazali&quot;&gt;@ayaangazali&lt;/a&gt; resolved the Planner KV hit rate against the worker namespace (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13480&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13480/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13480&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/AineshSootha&quot;&gt;@AineshSootha&lt;/a&gt; cleaned up abort-monitor waiters in the vLLM backend (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13637&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13637/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13637&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jlonge4&quot;&gt;@jlonge4&lt;/a&gt; registered the Neuron NIXL connector in the KV connector protocols (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13771&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13771/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13771&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/merceod&quot;&gt;@merceod&lt;/a&gt; added &lt;code&gt;extra_body&lt;/code&gt; passthrough to media request structs (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13817&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13817/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13817&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jankwi&quot;&gt;@Jankwi&lt;/a&gt; forwarded &lt;code&gt;media_io_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; for worker-side video decoding (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13826&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13826/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13826&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/houshengbo&quot;&gt;@houshengbo&lt;/a&gt; honored &lt;code&gt;continue_final_message&lt;/code&gt; in the Rust chat preprocessor (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13841&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13841/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13841&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Jonny-Skelton&quot;&gt;@Jonny-Skelton&lt;/a&gt; mapped &lt;code&gt;min_tokens&lt;/code&gt; to SGLang&#39;s &lt;code&gt;min_new_tokens&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13865&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/13865/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13865&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Rexwang8&quot;&gt;@Rexwang8&lt;/a&gt; returned HTTP 400 for unsupported multimodal content (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14056&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14056/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14056&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/luckyq&quot;&gt;@luckyq&lt;/a&gt; backported the chat logprobs fixes to the release branch (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14621&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/14621/hovercard&quot;&gt;#14621&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you would like to get involved, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.nvidia.com/dynamo/dev/getting-started/contribution-guide&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Contribution Guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
